  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-054 (Phase 3 — engine / Flows (`HFRClient`) — fetch → parse → submit → classify ([ADR 0008](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/adr/0008-hfrclient-orchestration-module.md))): Poll vote.\n\n### Scope\n\nPoll vote\n\n- Module: HFRClient · Difficulty: medium · Priority: medium\n- Audit source: D11\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-026 (#54), LOT-037 (#64)\n\n### Blocked by\n\npending capture CAP-poll-vote-answer-other-refusal-sentences (#138) (the poll vote answer is not captured; LOT-037 (#64) classifies it by shape only). Dependencies LOT-026 (#54) and LOT-037 (#64) are done.\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-054-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\nNone recorded.\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#82](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/82) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-poll-vote-answer-other-refusal-sentences (#138)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked`.\n",
